@startuml
!theme plain
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title Ticket Implementation and Independent Acceptance

state "Main dispatches fresh Ticket owner\nDefault Sol / low; scoped contract" as dispatch
state "Owner scopes Ticket work\nDependencies / acceptance / validation" as select
state "Owner implements Ticket\nRetain context through local repairs" as implement
state "Local focused checks\nCheapest relevant checks first" as focused
state "Diagnose failure" as diagnose
state "Implementation worker fixes in-scope defect" as fix
state "BLOCKED\nRecord cause + verified checkpoint" as blocked
state "Owner returns to main for re-planning" as replan
state "Ticket locally complete\nRecord evidence" as ticket_local
state "Development Complete\nTicket implemented + locally checked" as developed
state "Main dispatches fresh verifier\nRead-only; all Ticket scenarios" as verify
state "Verifier reports acceptance + mandatory dimensions\nExecuted evidence or concrete N/A reasons" as evidence
state "Main coordinator decides Test Quality Gate" as gate
state "Fresh implementation repair (default Sol/low)\nRun checks; retain evidence and round count" as repair
state "Checkpoint + pause affected problem\nAsk user to choose escalation model" as sol_repair
state "Verification BLOCKED\nRecord verification resume point" as verify_blocked
state "Ticket acceptance verified" as ticket_done
state "After all Tickets pass: final Plan acceptance\nSeparate fresh verifier for multi-Ticket Plans" as final_verify
state "Plan acceptance verified" as plan_done

[*] --> dispatch
dispatch --> select
select --> implement
implement --> focused
focused --> diagnose : failure
focused --> ticket_local : local checks pass
diagnose --> fix : implementation / test / regression defect
fix --> focused
diagnose --> blocked : dependency / environment
blocked --> select : cause resolved
diagnose --> replan : requirement / design conflict
implement --> replan : wrong assumption
replan --> select
ticket_local --> developed
developed --> verify
verify --> evidence
evidence --> repair : FAIL: return to implementation
repair --> verify : repaired + locally checked; dispatch new verifier
repair --> repair : same problem fails; repair rounds below 2
repair --> sol_repair : same problem fails after repair round 2
sol_repair --> repair : user selects available model; compatible role; low effort
sol_repair --> sol_repair : no selection or unsupported settings; no dispatch
evidence --> verify_blocked : checks cannot run
verify_blocked --> verify : cause resolved
evidence --> gate : complete evidence
gate --> ticket_done : PASS
gate --> verify : evidence gap; no repair needed
ticket_done --> final_verify : multi-Ticket Plan
ticket_done --> plan_done : one-Ticket Plan; exact same scope, artifact,
plan_done --> [*]
final_verify --> plan_done : PASS

note right of developed
Local RED/GREEN runs within the Ticket owner.
Formal verification covers the whole Ticket.
One-Ticket final acceptance may use this verifier only when scope,
artifact/version, configuration and deployment surface exactly match.
Multi-Ticket Plans require a separate fresh final verifier.
All workers are leaves and never spawn agents. Main retains design, integration and gates.
Context isolation does not isolate files or shared test state.
end note

note right of gate
Every acceptance criterion needs executed evidence.
Mandatory dimensions pass or have concrete N/A reasons.
Retry or agent replacement cannot erase unexplained flakiness.
The initial implementation failure is not a repair round.
After two consecutive failed same-problem repair rounds, diagnose and checkpoint.
Pause that problem until explicit user model selection; preserve history.
No automatic model choice or fallback. Unrelated work retains defaults.
Canonical routing: SKILL.md#codex-worker-model-routing
end note
@enduml
